  m_text: 'Play: click a card, or Enter / gamepad A on the focused card.  Cue: right-click a card, or C / gamepad X (C cues the card under the mouse, else the focused one). Cueing ends your plays this turn.

    Move focus: arrows / d-pad / stick.  Tooltips: hover or focus; T / gamepad Y hides or shows them.  End turn: E / gamepad Start.  Log: focus it and press up / down, or Page Up / Page Down.'
